  "final_answer": "I have all the information needed to answer the question. Let me compile the final answer.\n\n## Apple Stores Near Zip Code 90028 (Hollywood, CA)\n\nBased on my search of Google Maps for Apple Stores near zip code 90028, here are the **6 official Apple Stores** found in the greater Los Angeles area:\n\n| # | Apple Store | Address | Rating | Approx. Distance |\n|---|------------|---------|--------|------------------|\n| 1 | **Apple The Grove** | 189 The Grove Dr, Los Angeles | 4.0 ★ (2,525 reviews) | ~3 mi (closest) |\n| 2 | **Apple Beverly Center** | 8500 Beverly Blvd, Los Angeles | 3.8 ★ (622 reviews) | ~4 mi west |\n| 3 | **Apple Century City** | 10250 Santa Monica Blvd, Los Angeles | 3.4 ★ (1,214 reviews) | ~5 mi southwest |\n| 4 | **Apple Tower Theatre** | 802 S Broadway, Los Angeles | 4.2 ★ (1,132 reviews) | ~6 mi SE (downtown) |\n| 5 | **Apple Glendale Galleria** | 2126 Galleria Way, Glendale | 3.8 ★ (1,083 reviews) | ~5–6 mi north |\n| 6 | **Apple The Americana at Brand** | 877 Americana Way, Glendale | 3.9 ★ (1,134 reviews) | ~7 mi north |\n\n### Closest Apple Stores to 90028 (Hollywood):\n- 🥇 **Apple The Grove** — the closest at roughly 3 miles away\n- 🥈 **Apple Beverly Center** — about 4 miles away\n- 🥉 **Apple Century City** — about 5 miles away\n\n**Note:** The search also returned three non-Apple retail listings (iCarryAll Hollywood, MelroseMAC, and MacPro-LA) that share the word \"Apple\" or \"Mac\" in their names but are not official Apple Stores. I excluded those from the list above.",
